      "title": "Pentair Investor Alert: Johnson Fistel Reviews Potential Claims for Shareholders",
      "summary": "Johnson Fistel is investigating Pentair plc (NYSE: PNR) on behalf of investors who suffered losses following the company's July 14, 2026 disclosure of a dramatic miss on sales guidance. Pentair projected second-quarter sales would decline 17% year-over-year instead of growing 1%, citing unexpected Pool channel inventory destocking of approximately $170 million. The company also slashed full-year guidance from 2-4% growth to 4-7% decline, and reduced EPS guidance from $5.30-$5.40 to $4.60-$4.80. The stock declined approximately 22% in premarket trading following the announcement, and the company's CFO departed on July 10, 2026.",
